       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    PLANMNT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  FIBERNET - BROADBAND PLAN MASTER MAINTENANCE                   
      *  FUNCTION : Add / Change / Delete / Inquiry on PLANMAST.        
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PLANMAST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-PLANMAST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-PLAN-STS.
           SELECT DSPF ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-PLANMNTD-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PLANMAST LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF PLANMAST.
       FD  DSPF     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF PLANMNTD.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-STATUS-FLAGS.
           05  WS-PLAN-STS     PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-DSP-STS      PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-INDIC.
           05  EXIT-KEY        PIC 1 INDICATOR 03 VALUE B"0".
           05  CANCEL-KEY      PIC 1 INDICATOR 12 VALUE B"0".
       01  WS-FOUND-SW         PIC X(01) VALUE "N".
           88  REC-FOUND                 VALUE "Y".
           88  REC-NOTFOUND              VALUE "N".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       000-MAIN.
           OPEN I-O PLANMAST.
           OPEN I-O DSPF.
           PERFORM 100-PROCESS UNTIL EXIT-KEY = B"1".
           CLOSE PLANMAST DSPF.
           GOBACK.

       100-PROCESS.
           MOVE SPACES TO MSGTXT.
           MOVE ZEROS  TO PLANID OF PLANPMT.
           MOVE SPACES TO ACTION.
           WRITE PLANPMT.
           READ DSPF.
           IF EXIT-KEY = B"1"
               GO TO 100-EXIT
           END-IF.
           MOVE PLANID OF PLANPMT TO PLANID OF PLANREC.
           EVALUATE ACTION
               WHEN "A"  PERFORM 200-ADD
               WHEN "C"  PERFORM 300-CHANGE
               WHEN "D"  PERFORM 400-DELETE
               WHEN "I"  PERFORM 500-INQUIRY
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE "Invalid action." TO MSGTXT
                   WRITE PLANPMT
                   READ DSPF
           END-EVALUATE.
       100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       200-ADD.
           PERFORM 600-READ-PLAN.
           IF REC-FOUND
               MOVE "Plan already exists." TO MSGTXT
               GO TO 200-EXIT
           END-IF.
           INITIALIZE PLANDTL.
           MOVE "A" TO PLANSTS.
           WRITE PLANDTL.
           READ DSPF.
           IF EXIT-KEY = B"1" OR CANCEL-KEY = B"1"
               GO TO 200-EXIT
           END-IF.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING PLANDTL TO PLANREC.
           WRITE PLANREC.
           IF WS-PLAN-STS = "00"
               MOVE "Plan added successfully." TO MSGTXT
           ELSE
               MOVE "Add failed - file error." TO MSGTXT
           END-IF.
       200-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       300-CHANGE.
           PERFORM 600-READ-PLAN.
           IF REC-NOTFOUND
               MOVE "Plan not found." TO MSGTXT
               GO TO 300-EXIT
           END-IF.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING PLANREC TO PLANDTL.
           WRITE PLANDTL.
           READ DSPF.
           IF EXIT-KEY = B"1" OR CANCEL-KEY = B"1"
               GO TO 300-EXIT
           END-IF.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING PLANDTL TO PLANREC.
           REWRITE PLANREC.
           IF WS-PLAN-STS = "00"
               MOVE "Plan updated." TO MSGTXT
           ELSE
               MOVE "Update failed." TO MSGTXT
           END-IF.
       300-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       400-DELETE.
           PERFORM 600-READ-PLAN.
           IF REC-NOTFOUND
               MOVE "Plan not found." TO MSGTXT
               GO TO 400-EXIT
           END-IF.
           DELETE PLANMAST RECORD.
           IF WS-PLAN-STS = "00"
               MOVE "Plan deleted." TO MSGTXT
           ELSE
               MOVE "Delete failed." TO MSGTXT
           END-IF.
       400-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       500-INQUIRY.
           PERFORM 600-READ-PLAN.
           IF REC-NOTFOUND
               MOVE "Plan not found." TO MSGTXT
               GO TO 500-EXIT
           END-IF.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING PLANREC TO PLANDTL.
           WRITE PLANDTL.
           READ DSPF.
           MOVE "End of inquiry." TO MSGTXT.
       500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       600-READ-PLAN.
           READ PLANMAST
               INVALID KEY     SET REC-NOTFOUND TO TRUE
               NOT INVALID KEY SET REC-FOUND    TO TRUE
           END-READ.
       600-EXIT.
           EXIT.
